Subject: [PATCH 55/56] bench: paced engine GC harness with two-binary compare

Vendors the game-engine gc_benchmark (commit 88f28dfe) with 60 Hz pacing,
frameStats deltas, and RESULT lines. Build and compare scripts never link
both collectors into one binary. Includes alloc_micro for A/B/C falsification.

